--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix crash on regular expressions containing commas in ``regexp_csv`` options such as
+``bad-names-rgxs``: commas inside ``{m,n}`` quantifiers (or escaped as ``\,``) no longer
+split the expression.
+
+Closes #7229
